                                "example_id": "77018678-25c8-479d-8955-9266e9aba2b7",
                                "sense_id": "d5e7b4c4-371d-34f8-a509-8b417c446457",
                                "text": "A second group, with the joing positioned more anteriorly and with shorter, less natantly-adapted antennules, became active (though not necessarily efficient) swimmers."
